gaYw(){return"Your account (e-mail, display name, hashed password), your profile as you fill it (photo, status, address, WhatsApp number \u2014 each optional), and what you do in a space: bookings and check-ins, messages, expenses and consumptions, your subscription, invoices and payments. All of it is stored on the server your space runs on: on the shared reference server, in the EU (Supabase, eu-central-1); on a server a community runs itself, wherever its operator chose. Settings \u2192 Privacy & data shows that server's notice: who runs it, where the data is and who receives it."},
gaYx(){return"What DesKilo processes"},
