gbc2(){return"Who keeps the official books of each issuer: Deskilo as pre-accounting, a local book, or an external accounting system that stays authoritative. Each issuer states its currency, fiscal year and accounting basis. Off: member balances and invoices work as before."},
gbc3(){return"Accounting book"},
gbc4(){return"Connects each issuer's books to the accounting system they are kept in (Pennylane and bexio through their APIs, the others by file), names each account, tax code and customer as that system knows it, and lists every file and delivery that carried a document with its SHA-256: the digital link a tax inspection asks to see."},
gbc5(){return"Accounting systems"},
gbc6(){return"Close a period of the books so that no invoice dated inside it can be voided and no payment matched inside it, and keep a log of every accounting export. Off: nothing is locked and exports are not logged."},
