cCe(a){return"Switching this on also enables "+a},
gbce(){return"The long-lasting equipment the space buys, kept apart from day-to-day purchases: each acquisition is a candidate until someone who manages the accounting decides whether it is capitalised or expensed, and when it came into use. Off: purchases stay as they are and no equipment is registered."},
gbcf(){return"Equipment register"},
gbcg(){return"Auto check-in/out at day end"},
gbch(){return"Reservations never checked in or out complete themselves once their time has passed."},
cCf(a){return"Available in "+a},
gbci(){return"Members can sign in by scanning their badge and entering their PIN, instead of typing an e-mail on a shared tablet. Each member sets their own PIN and arms their own badge."},
gbcj(){return"Sign in with a badge"},
gbck(){return"Reads the bank's statement files (camt.053/054, MT940, CODA, OFX/QFX or a spreadsheet) into the space, each movement once, and suggests the invoice each payment settles by the QR or RF reference printed on it, its number or its amount; a person confirms every match, and the rest stays in a work list. A payment out reconciles a payment already recorded as made."},
gbcl(){return"Bank statements"},
gbcm(){return"Turn a saved analysis into an editable report of pages and cards. A report stores the question, never the figures: everyone sees only what their own rights allow. Off: saved views stay as they are and existing reports can still be read."},
gbcn(){return"Report designer (analytics)"},
gbco(){return"Book for others"},
gbcp(){return"Admins and owners book seats for other members."},
gbcq(){return"Every booking surface \u2014 plan, day, week and month views, the booking sheet, the kiosk, a QR or NFC scan \u2014 checks the availability parameters before offering a window and names the reason when it cannot; closed days draw as closed in every view, a legend names the seat states, and admins may check members out where the policy allows."},
gbcr(){return"Booking gate"},
gbcs(){return"Owner-configurable booking behavior: past bookings, minute bookings outside the working hours, and check-out by admins."},
gBk(){return"Booking policies"},
gbct(){return"Lets a member save one of their own bookings as a standard calendar file (.ics) for the calendar they already use. The file carries the time, the booked space and the workspace name only \u2014 no amount, no name, no note, no link \u2014 and it is a snapshot: a later change to the booking does not update a file already saved. Nothing is written to any calendar and nothing syncs. Off hides the button."},
gbcu(){return"Calendar file of a booking"},
gbcv(){return"The calendar shows everything dated \u2014 bookings, check-ins, alerts, messages, invoices, payments, consumption, reminders \u2014 for a day or a range, each row opening its source. Off: reservations only."},
gbcw(){return"Calendar hub"},
gbcx(){return"Calendar tab"},
gbcy(){return"Monthly overview of bookings and closed days."},
gbcz(){return"Every decision taken on an event appears on the calendar at the moment it was taken, not at the moment of the event: who validated or refused what, and when. Tapping one opens its trail. Off: the calendar carries no decisions."},
gbcA(){return"Validations on the calendar"},
gbcB(){return"The Calendar tab as agenda, week and month: per-day markers by kind, closed days drawn as closed, Today / Tomorrow headers, payment due dates and scheduled expenses in the feed. Off: the plain day-or-range selector over the feed."},
gbcC(){return"Calendar views"},
gbcD(){return"Shows owners and reservation managers how much of the offered seat time was reserved in a month, with how it is computed and what the figure cannot know."},
gbcE(){return"Seat utilisation"},
gbcF(){return"Message screens refuse screenshots and screen recording where the device allows it, hide their content while the screen is recorded, and announce a screenshot in the conversation where it can only be detected. A browser cannot block screenshots; there the thread is blurred when the tab loses focus."},
gbcG(){return"Screen capture protection"},
gbcH(){return"Sell carnets of half-days that are spent across months when a member books beyond their subscription, charged once at the sale."},
gbcI(){return"Carnets"},
ga5J(){return"The change was sent, but the features could not be reloaded to confirm it. Reopen the screen to see what is set."},
ga5K(){return"The features changed meanwhile, so nothing was written. Check the list and switch again."},
