gbcK(){return"Appoint co-owners: owner permissions now (active) or succession-in-waiting (passive)."},
gbcL(){return"Limits, windows and defaults you change in the app instead of waiting for a release: the platform owner sets the defaults, a workspace's administrators their own values."},
gbcM(){return"Configurable settings"},
gbcN(){return"Configuration in the space file"},
gbcO(){return"The space file (XML) carries the whole configuration \u2014 tariffs, legal identity, booking and validation rules, roles, document designs, sites, closure days \u2014 and importing it applies it, even on a space that already has bookings. Off: the file carries settings and floor plan only."},
gbcP(){return"the European Union"},
